{
 "duration": 24.846,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ben and his daughter finished their first hike in Zion.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.034
  },
  {
   "text": "At the visitor center, people were stamping little books at a desk.",
   "start": 3.234,
   "end": 6.48
  },
  {
   "text": "Ben had nothing to stamp, so they walked out.",
   "start": 6.68,
   "end": 9.164
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Most national park visitor centers keep a free ink stamp with the park's name and date.",
   "start": 9.664,
   "end": 15.682
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring a page for it.",
   "start": 15.932,
   "end": 16.989
  },
  {
   "text": "Log the trail and the date beside it.",
   "start": 17.189,
   "end": 19.279
  },
  {
   "text": "Now every trip leaves a mark.",
   "start": 19.779,
   "end": 21.439
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next park visit.",
   "start": 22.739,
   "end": 24.646
  }
 ],
